[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Dwynen's Elite
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
